    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404210/extras/9ede8db0c093f988ccc5bd3c37760a9d.poster.avif?t=1755133672\" width=600 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404210/extras/9ede8db0c093f988ccc5bd3c37760a9d.webm?t=1755133672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404210/extras/9ede8db0c093f988ccc5bd3c37760a9d.mp4?t=1755133672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEX IS AN ART, SO YOU NEED TO BE AN ARTIST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a student at a prestigious academy of arts.\u00a0One year. Dozens of opportunities. Hundreds of choices that will shape your future.\u00a0Dive into a world of passion, creativity, and temptation.\u00a0Discover who you truly are \u2014 and who you want to become in love and in art.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE AND LIVING CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 main girls, each one handcrafted with the finest details in appearance, personality, and backstory.\u00a0They feel real emotions \u2014 love, pain, jealousy, and dreams.\u00a0Each girl has her own personal drama and secrets that only you can uncover.\u00a0Their stories cross paths, creating a unique atmosphere and unlocking unexpected opportunities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY DECISION MATTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building relationships is complex.\u00a0Even the smallest details make a difference.\u00a0Even your likes and follows on social media will affect your relationships \u2014 sometimes across multiple girls at once. Don\u2019t be afraid to mess up or make the wrong move. You\u2019ll have a chance to fix things \u2014 and maybe even deepen the connection because of it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romance. Find the one girl who makes you forget all the rest. Build a deep, sincere, and emotional connection that\u2019s truly yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harem. Try to win over several hearts at once and experience the challenge of balancing jealousy, passion, and intrigue. Each girl is a person, and you\u2019ll need all your charm and cleverness to keep them close.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen Angel. Your path is seduction and the freedom to explore the darkest fantasies. Reveal each girl\u2019s hidden desires. Break their moral boundaries and lead them into a world of forbidden pleasure. Find the key to every heart and become the one who changes their idea of lust and satisfaction forever.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A VISUAL DELIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created with professional 3D technology, the game offers exceptional detail and realism in every scene and character. You\u2019ll experience vivid, emotionally charged dates, intense sensual scenes, and an unforgettable atmosphere \u2014 every frame crafted with care and love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404210/extras/595cab6dc4669e3463b9750fc3c0de0b.avif?t=1755133672\" data-has-big width=800 height=118 /></span></p>",
